01:15:50.884 --> 01:15:53.428
Dad, you okay?


01:15:53.512 --> 01:15:57.474
l'm always okay.
We were just celebrating.


01:16:08.610 --> 01:16:10.070
Dick.


01:16:10.112 --> 01:16:11.822
You look tired, Dick,
how you doing?


01:16:11.905 --> 01:16:16.159
Jesus, by now l was expecting
a postcard from Ensenada.


01:16:16.243 --> 01:16:17.786
-You get anything?
-We got anything?


01:16:17.870 --> 01:16:19.663
l don't know,
let's check.


01:16:19.746 --> 01:16:22.082
These count?


01:16:22.124 --> 01:16:23.709
You know, why don't you
get Dick's opinion?


01:16:23.792 --> 01:16:25.085
Three, what do you
think of that?


01:16:25.127 --> 01:16:28.589
Whoa whoa whoa whoa.
Before you answer, how about four?


01:16:28.672 --> 01:16:31.216
Of course, five is a number
that everybody is comfortable with.


01:16:31.300 --> 01:16:33.510
Probably the hand,
somethin' to do with that.


01:16:33.594 --> 01:16:34.845
You wrote five?


01:16:34.928 --> 01:16:36.847
No.


01:16:36.930 --> 01:16:38.307
Six.


01:16:38.390 --> 01:16:40.434
of course if l told you six,
l'd be lying.


01:16:40.517 --> 01:16:42.603
- Because he'd be forgetting seven.
- Seven.


01:16:42.644 --> 01:16:44.730
What the hell is this?


01:16:44.813 --> 01:16:47.691
Seven. We wrote
some paper-- seven.


01:16:47.774 --> 01:16:50.527
You want me to spike
seven boxes?


01:16:50.611 --> 01:16:54.281
No, no, on this one
be leisurely, 'cause this is gold.


01:16:54.323 --> 01:16:56.992
We got cash.
21 grand.


01:16:57.075 --> 01:16:59.203
Minus our commission.


01:17:27.689 --> 01:17:31.276
What is this? There you go.
Come on, honey, jump on.


01:17:31.360 --> 01:17:33.278
Mom, look what
Daddy got me.


01:17:33.362 --> 01:17:36.323
- That's it, honey.
- Come on, come on. Ready?


01:17:36.406 --> 01:17:39.117
-Yes, l am.
-We're gonna go up high.


01:17:39.201 --> 01:17:41.036
Ain't she beautiful?


01:17:41.078 --> 01:17:42.538
Maury, don't burn
my chicken.


01:17:42.621 --> 01:17:44.998
You're burning
the chicken, you idiot.


01:17:46.124 --> 01:17:48.377
Here's what we do--
some of this.

